WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:05.109
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed To
Do At The SCP Foundation: Sending copies of

00:00:05.109 --> 00:00:10.250
SCP-1981, Ronald Reagan Cut Up While Talking,
To America’s Funniest Home Videos.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:14.910
Look, Jack, there are a lot of things that
Ronald Reagan can be rightly criticized for,

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:19.800
from his appalling response to the AIDS crisis
to the whole Iran-Contra debacle, but we still

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.660
don’t think it’s worth sending an anomalous
tape of him being destroyed during one of

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:26.280
his speeches to America’s Funniest Home
Videos.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:30.210
I think that constitutes a pretty major containment
breach…

